      <tbody>
        <tr id="source-2"><td>2</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-dmz-how-to-play-forward-operating-base-guide">DMZ Deep Dive Part 2: FOB Full Intel Guide</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>Campaign EA Oct 16；DMZ EA Oct 20；发售 Oct 23；数字预购资格；时区/停机脚注</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-3"><td>3</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-campaign-early-access-live-now">Campaign Early Access Now Live</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>战役 EA 自 Oct 16 起；正式发售 Oct 23</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-5"><td>5</td><td><a href="https://support.activision.com/modern-warfare-4/articles/modern-warfare-4-editions">Activision Support · MW4 Editions</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>全球发售与 EA 日历；版本资格；平台列表</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-6"><td>6</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-intel-modern-warfare-4-launch-xbox-game-pass">COD Intel · Launch / Game Pass</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>Oct 23 独立发售；发售时不上 Game Pass（至 Holiday 2027）</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-7"><td>7</td><td><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4435490/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_4/">Steam · Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 商店页</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>仅作购买入口外链；价格与 SKU 以商店为准</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
